  "description": "Meet the all-new EX6F Folding Electric Bike—an upgraded take on the EX6, built for enhanced comfort, smarter portability, and a more inclusive fit.\nFeaturing a UL 2849-certified 48V 14.5Ah battery, the EX6F delivers up to 75 miles of range, powered by a 750W peak motor that handles city streets and hills with ease.\nThe low-step frame (15.7\"), adjustable handlebar (44.5\"–52.76\"), and seat height (33.66\"–41.14\") make it perfect for riders from 4'9″ to 6'5″. Thanks to its 3-point folding system and removable battery, it's ideal for compact storage or travel.\nAdd in 20×4.0\" fat tires, a hydraulic front suspension fork, and a rear rack supporting up to 110 lbs, and the EX6F is ready to go the distance—fold, grab, and go anywhere life takes you.",
